 "description": "Look up a domain's reputation via VirusTotal (no scheme, e.g. \"example.com\"). Returns engine analysis stats (malicious/suspicious/harmless/undetected counts and percent), reputation score, community votes, tags, last-analyzed date, and a link to the VirusTotal GUI report.",
 "inputSchema": {
